# A blocked presenter cannot prevent urgent shutdown.
@phase 1.2
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
! block-stdout
< frobnicate
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms
---
# Search progress is droppable, but a completed search must survive a slow reader.
@phase 6.3
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
! block-stdout
< position startpos
< go movetime 150
! sleep 250ms
! unblock-stdout
! allow-info begin
> {{BESTMOVE_LINE}}
! allow-info end
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms
